:"family","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC/affiliate","source":"https://www.budapestbylocals.com/caving-in-budapest/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"The river-cruise-and-spa senior city break","si_tag":"senior","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~€150-500/day land","timing":"shoulder Apr + Oct ideal","commission_path":"cruise-line/DMC 10-16%","draw_rank":1,"hook":"Budapest is a top Danube-cruise turn plus flat Pest boulevards, accessible baths and gentle, high-reward culture","si":"senior","blurb":"Budapest is a top Danube-cruise turn plus flat Pest boulevards, accessible baths and gentle, high-reward culture","when":"shoulder Apr + Oct ideal","commission":"cruise-line/DMC 10-16%"},{"name":"The SPAR Budapest Marathon","si_tag":"sports","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"entry ~€40-120 + stay","timing":"entries spring; race ~10-11 Oct 2026 — verify","commission_path":"running-travel operator/DMC 10-15%","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the 41st-edition October running festival — marathon / half / 30k / 14k / 10k / 5k along the Danube","si":"sports","blurb":"the 41st-edition October running festival — marathon / half / 30k / 14k / 10k / 5k along the Danube","when":"entries spring; race ~10-11 Oct 2026 — verify","commission":"running-travel operator/DMC 10-15%","source":"https://worldsmarathons.com/marathon/budapest-marathon","accessed":"2026-07-27"}],"faq":[{"q":"Is Budapest safe to visit right now?","a":"Yes — freely bookable. Hungary is US Level 1 (Exercise Normal Precautions), the safest tier, reissued 15 April 2026; the only everyday caution is pickpocketing on transport and in nightlife districts.","source":"bbj.hu","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Budapest?","a":"Not crime — the water and the money: the Danube runs fast, deep and cold (not for swimming), and the Forint invites dynamic-currency-conversion and street-exchange scams, so keep to crew-supervised boats and pay by card.","source":"visithungary.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is caving in Budapest dangerous?","a":"No — it is guided and beginner-friendly. Tours of the Palvolgyi and Szemlohegyi caves run 50-60 minutes at a constant 8-10 C with a guide; Szemlohegyi is a squeeze-free show cave good for families.","source":"budapestbylocals.com","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"When is the best time to cruise the Danube from Budapest?","a":"Late March to late December — spring and summer for terraces and baths, and late November-December for the Christmas-market sailings that make Budapest a marquee Advent start.","source":"usnews.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which river-cruise lines leave from Budapest?","a":"Nine confirmed — Viking, AmaWaterways, Avalon, Uniworld, Scenic, Tauck, Emerald, CroisiEurope and Riviera Travel — because Budapest is the eastern terminus of the classic Upper Danube itinerary to Passau, Regensburg and Nuremberg.","source":"usnews.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which Budapest thermal bath should I choose?","a":"It depends: Szechenyi (among Europe''s largest, Neo-Baroque, City Park) for the grand day and the night sparty; Gellert for Art-Nouveau elegance; Rudas (16th-century Ottoman) for the Danube-view rooftop pool.","source":"visithungary.com","si_tag":"wellness"},{"q":"Is Budapest a serious food city?","a":"Yes — it holds 7 Michelin stars (Stand at two), because a modern-Hungarian fine-dining scene has matured atop the classic table; pair a starred dinner with the 1897 Great Market Hall and a Tokaji or palinka flight.","source":"guide.michelin.com","si_tag":"culinary"},{"q":"Can you run a marathon in Budapest?","a":"Yes — the SPAR Budapest Marathon (41st edition, ~10-11 Oct 2026) runs 6 distances from 5 km to the full 42.2 km along the Danube, sold as an entry-plus-stay running-travel package.","source":"worldsmarathons.com","si_tag":"sports"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Budapest Travel Guide: Danube River Cruises, Thermal Baths, Michelin Dining & the UNESCO Panorama","meta_description":"Plan Budapest — the Danube''s eastern anchor: the UNESCO riverfront panorama, the Danube-cruise embarkation hub, the by-night dinner cruise, the thermal-bath City of Spas, 7 Michelin stars, Hungarian wine and palinka, the State Opera, House of Terror and Buda-Hills caves.","slug":"budapest-hungary","primary_keyword":"Budapest travel guide","long_tail":["Budapest Danube river cruise embarkation","Szechenyi thermal baths Budapest","Budapest Michelin star restaurants","Tokaji wine tasting Budapest","House of Terror Memento Park","SPAR Budapest Marathon"],"search_language":"hu-HU","local_keywords":["Budapest utazas","Duna latkep","Orszaghaz","Lanchid","Budai Var","Halaszbastya","Szechenyi gyogyfurdo","Gellert furdo","Rudas furdo","Nagycsarnok","Tokaji bor","Egri Bikaver","palinka","Magyar Allami Operahaz","Liszt Ferenc Zeneakademia","Terror Haza","Palvolgyi-barlang","SPAR Budapest Maraton","romkocsma"],"hreflang":["en","hu-HU"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-27"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L1","codes":[],"advisory_updated":"2026-04-15","consent_flow":false,"note":"Hungary US L1 (Exercise Normal Precautions), safest tier"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-27","hits":13,"misses":9,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to My Sports Travel (participant); spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded per scope"},"sis_present":[{"si":"river","name":"river","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"wellness","name":"Wellness Spas & Retreats","status":"live"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"culture","name":"Culture & History","status":"future"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future"},{"si":"entertainment","name":"entertainment","status":"future"},{"si":"nightlife","name":"nightlife","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"family","name":"family","status":"future"},{"si":"senior","name":"senior","status":"future"},{"si":"sports","name":"My Sports Travel","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Luxury Danube cruise anchored at Budapest (Uniworld/Scenic/Tauck/AmaWaterways/Emerald)","why_ultra":"suite embarking beneath the floodlit Parliament, Christmas-market dates","earning":"cruise-line/host 10-16%","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€4,000-12,000+/pp"},{"name":"Four Seasons Gresham Palace / Matild Palace — Danube-front Art-Nouveau suite","why_ultra":"river-view suite over the Chain Bridge, the grandest Pest address, spa + fine dining","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€600-1,500+/night"},{"name":"A private Budapest night — chartered dinner cruise + two-star table + after-hours thermal bath","why_ultra":"private boat past the illuminated panorama, dinner at Stand, a curated late soak, chauffeured","earning":"DMC + venue","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"luxury-ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-27","hero":{"query":"Budapest, Hungary"},"geo":{"lat":47.4979,"lng":19.0402}}'::jsonb, 36)
